-				"Type": "enum",
-				"Doc": "symbolStyle controls how symbols are qualified in symbol responses.\n\nExample Usage:\n\n```json5\n\"gopls\": {\n...\n  \"symbolStyle\": \"Dynamic\",\n...\n}\n```\n",
-				"EnumKeys": {
