-			"Name": "QF1007",
-			"Doc": "Merge conditional assignment into variable declaration\n\nBefore:\n\n    x := false\n    if someCondition {\n        x = true\n    }\n\nAfter:\n\n    x := someCondition\n\nAvailable since\n    2021.1\n",
